{"type":"npc","name":"Monolithic Cube (Metaphysical Concepts)","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":140,"temp":0,"max":140,"details":""},"ac":{"value":29,"details":"(25 when broken), construct armor"},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":15,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":"cubic movement"},"hardness":{"value":10}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":[],"details":""},"level":{"value":9},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Originally built into ancient pyramids as defenders, monolithic cubes are massive cubic constructs, typically made of granite. Despite their name, monolithic cubes are not a single mass of stone. Instead, their exterior shell is a thick layer of rock, while their interiors are a semi-fluid slurry of mercury, iron shavings, fine gravel, and blood. Most scholars believe that the only \"living\" portion of the cube is this internal fluid—a simple elemental spirit that uses magnetic forces to animate the cube and follow its creator's will.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 90/200/360 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), armor (medium, heavy), shield, perception item, skill items (Athletics)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> body, bane, constitution, earth, earth armor, energy resistant (spirit, vitality, void), metal, mind, mind shield, music, poison, poisonous armor, strength, sturdy, throwing, time, wild, wisdom</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Dejan Veskovic","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":6},"dex":{"mod":-2},"con":{"mod":6},"int":{"mod":-5},"wis":{"mod":2},"cha":{"mod":-5}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":15,"senses":[{"type":"motion-sense","acuity":"precise","range":60}],"vision":false},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":21,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":14,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":16,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":20}},"traits":{"value":["construct","mindless"],"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"huge"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/monolithic-cube.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Monolithic Cube","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":3,"height":3,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/monolithic-cube.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/monolithic-cube.webp"}},"flags":{"sf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false,"linkToActorScale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"type":"action","name":"The Die is Cast","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The faces of some monolithic cubes are etched with enormous numerals representing metaphysical concepts. Depending on which number is on the cube's top face, these numerals grant the cube immunity to a certain type of damage, while revealing a weakness to another. The numerals, the concepts they represent, and the immunities and weaknesses of each number follow.</p><p><strong>1. Might:</strong> Immunity to damage dealt by weapons and weakness 10 to spell damage.</p><p><strong>2. Frost:</strong> Immunity to cold damage and weakness 10 to fire damage.</p><p><strong>3. Lightning:</strong> Immunity to electricity damage and weakness 10 to sonic damage.</p><p><strong>4. Thunder:</strong> Immunity to sonic damage and weakness 10 to electricity damage.</p><p><strong>5. Flame:</strong> Immunity to fire damage and weakness 10 to cold damage.</p><p><strong>6. Magic:</strong> Immunity to spell damage and weakness 10 to damage dealt by weapons (apply only once per weapon Strike even if it has damaging property runes or the like).</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"the-die-is-cast","suboptions":[{"label":"BZES.SpecificRule.MonolithicCube.TheDieIsCast.Might","value":"might"},{"label":"BZES.SpecificRule.MonolithicCube.TheDieIsCast.Frost","value":"frost"},{"label":"BZES.SpecificRule.MonolithicCube.TheDieIsCast.Lightning","value":"lightning"},{"label":"BZES.SpecificRule.MonolithicCube.TheDieIsCast.Thunder","value":"thunder"},{"label":"BZES.SpecificRule.MonolithicCube.TheDieIsCast.Flame","value":"flame"},{"label":"BZES.SpecificRule.MonolithicCube.TheDieIsCast.Magic","value":"magic"}],"toggleable":true,"alwaysActive":true},{"key":"Immunity","type":"custom","definition":["item:type:weapon",{"not":"item:trait:unarmed"}],"predicate":["the-die-is-cast:might"],"label":"BZES.IWR.Custom.Weapons"},{"key":"Weakness","type":"spells","value":10,"predicate":["the-die-is-cast:might"]},{"key":"Immunity","type":"cold","predicate":["the-die-is-cast:frost"]},{"key":"Weakness","type":"fire","value":10,"predicate":["the-die-is-cast:frost"]},{"key":"Immunity","type":"electricity","predicate":["the-die-is-cast:lightning"]},{"key":"Weakness","type":"sonic","value":10,"predicate":["the-die-is-cast:lightning"]},{"key":"Immunity","type":"sonic","predicate":["the-die-is-cast:thunder"]},{"key":"Weakness","type":"electricity","value":10,"predicate":["the-die-is-cast:thunder"]},{"key":"Immunity","type":"fire","predicate":["the-die-is-cast:flame"]},{"key":"Weakness","type":"cold","value":10,"predicate":["the-die-is-cast:flame"]},{"key":"Immunity","type":"custom","definition":["item:type:spell","damaging-effect"],"predicate":["the-die-is-cast:magic"],"label":"BZES.IWR.Custom.DamageFromSpells"},{"key":"Weakness","type":"custom","definition":["item:type:weapon",{"not":"item:trait:unarmed"}],"value":10,"predicate":["the-die-is-cast:magic"],"label":"BZES.IWR.Custom.Weapons"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"2jIl3SRWE7UdzOiz","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Motion Sense","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A monolithic cube can sense nearby motion through vibration and air movement.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"dzwOzztYIFUP1Sp1","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Construct Armor (Hardness 10)","sort":300000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>Like normal objects, a monolithic cube has Hardness. This Hardness reduces any damage the cube takes by an amount equal to the Hardness. Once a monolithic cube is reduced to fewer than half its Hit Points, or immediately upon being damaged by a critical hit, its construct armor breaks, removing the Hardness, reducing its Armor Class to 25, and activating its mercurial quickness.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.NPCAbility.ConstructArmor.CriticalHit","option":"construct-armor","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":[{"or":["construct-armor",{"lt":["hp-percent",50]}]}],"selector":"ac","value":-4},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hardness.value","phase":"afterDerived","predicate":[{"or":["construct-armor",{"lt":["hp-percent",50]}]}],"value":0}],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"deathNote":false},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.pathfinder-monster-core.Actor.CFlx1tkRxKC9qAC7.Item.GhnXpFtWM1vyvu8V","duplicateSource":"Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.pathfinder-monster-core.Actor.CFlx1tkRxKC9qAC7.Item.GhnXpFtWM1vyvu8V","exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"R0unFgrEpobgLfSl"},{"type":"action","name":"Mercurial Quickness","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>While a monolithic cube's construct armor is broken, it is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl]{Quickened}. It can only use the additional action from quickened for Crushing Face. Additionally, it gains a mercury jet Strike.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"GrantItem","predicate":[{"or":["construct-armor",{"lt":["hp-percent",50]}]}],"uuid":"Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl","inMemoryOnly":true},{"damage":{"base":{"damageType":"bludgeoning","dice":2,"die":"d6","modifier":7}},"attackModifier":19,"traits":["brutal"],"key":"Strike","range":{"increment":30},"slug":"mercury-jet","label":"BZES.SpecificRule.MonolithicCube.MercuryJet","predicate":[{"or":["construct-armor",{"lt":["hp-percent",50]}]}]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"D7Lu3vJpoyQSPyc7","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Cubic Face","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"damageRolls":{"f1ppFHxH8KPDQQZ7":{"damage":"2d10+18","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":19},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"EqYW4GzboyAfwphB","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Crushing Face","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>A monolithic cube's primary means of both attack and locomotion is to roll over, crushing everything in its path. The monolithic cube Strides. During this Stride, the cube can move into and through the spaces of creatures and objects that are Large or smaller. Unattended objects in the path of a monolithic cube's crushing face automatically take @Damage[10d10[bludgeoning]] damage. Each creature whose space the monolithic cube enters takes @Damage[(2d10+6)[bludgeoning]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:28|basic] save). Wobbling between two faces slightly destabilizes the cube. If the cube uses Crushing Face to move in the opposite direction of its most recent Stride on the same turn, the DC of the Reflex save is reduced to @Check[reflex|dc:24|basic] .</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature moves to a square of its choice adjacent to the cube.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> As critical success, but the creature takes half damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage, moves to a square of its choice adjacent to the cube, and is knocked @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is crushed by the cube, taking double damage. It is knocked prone and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} underneath the cube, sharing its space while restrained in this way. A creature can [[/act escape dc=28]] to move to a square of its choice adjacent to the cube. If the cube leaves the creature's space, that creature is no longer restrained.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"IHnqDfzYRNdiJ0Dd","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Unstoppable Roll","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The monolithic cube is unaffected by difficult terrain and greater difficult terrain. Its Speed is always a multiple of 15 (such as 15, 30, or 45). It is unaffected by penalties that would reduce its Speed below 15. Bonuses to speed have no effect unless they would increase its Speed to a new multiple of 15.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"TXC6DfAYLIluJYSw","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Grind","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The monolithic cube deals @Damage[(2d10+8)[bludgeoning]] damage to each creature currently @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} by its crushing face (@Check[fortitude|dc:28|basic] save).</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"907KJaDYclHr8dYV","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Cubic Movement","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A monolithic cube moves by rolling from one face to another, leaving all of the spaces it previously occupied. As such, it can Stride only in straight lines and in cardinal directions, and it must always move exactly 15 feet. Stepping is a two-action activity for a monolithic cube.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"4MBf5m90rYzocQ74","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}}],"effects":[],"sort":5600000,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":"Actor.8DD4vJlrctXuKss5","exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.8.0"},"_id":"tTjoslHWcyOZ1UiT"}